      "content": "idk. coffee or simmering pots... it just feels like performing these little rituals for no reason. he was the only one who actually made sense to me. now there's just this huge gap where he used to be and everything else feels so fake and shallow. it's like i'm just going through the motions in a world that doesn't even matter anymore. why bother trying to \"fill the space\" when the space is exactly what's killing me?",
